## 🔄 Quick Review

### TOEIC

1. I enjoy _____ books.
→ reading

2. We decided _____ the meeting.
→ to postpone

3. She finished _____ the report.
→ writing

4. The company plans _____ a new branch.
→ to open

5. They are considering _____ the deadline.
→ extending

